+ * than uniformly plain: a ring you cannot rely on is a ring you cannot learn.
+ * This is the floor — anything with its own, better-fitted ring still wins,
+ * because a later or more specific rule beats this one. `:focus-visible` only,
+ * so a pointer never paints one.
