From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:40:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] The crate's position readout printed through the
 record's name

Caught by looks.mjs at 620px, which is the width the lint exists for: the
count was absolutely positioned at its own `bottom`, inside the space the
two lines above it need, so a subtitle that wrapped ran straight through
it. It is the third line of that block now and the flex column places it,
which is correct at every width rather than at the one it was tried at.

Goldens re-blessed across all 60 surfaces. The whole set moved, which is
expected: lifting the two muted ink tokens to AA repaints every muted
label in the application, and the sidebar gained two routes. Two
consecutive runs after blessing are byte-identical.

